SPOILER

When I have a reasonable amount of gold, I rob shops by dropping the
gold inside, then I can buy most of the items I want from the credit
and my pet only has to steal the gold back.
Even if you don`t have a pet, you can use this, because a number of
monsters also pick gold op and take it with them. Drop the gold in
the shop, let the monster get it, go outside and kill it.
The monsters seem to be able to get out of shops with all the goods
they want without having to pay. So I am probably the only one who
has to pay for the stuff. Well, maybe you too, but I think this is a
bug.

